{"3362670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crypt Robbery", "steam_appid": 3362670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.poster.avif?t=1780755955\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.webm?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.mp4?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crypt Robbery blends shooting and horror elements in a gritty, old-school style—crafted by a solo developer.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It’s a challenging experience, so consulting the Steam Community guide is highly recommended.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can play in two ways:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• \tMain Story: Dive into the story, with a slow progress, dominated by horror.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• \tMini-Games: Face off in challenges like Waves of Evil—a moderately paced survival FPS mode with limited time and scarce resources.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.poster.avif?t=1780755955\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.webm?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.mp4?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You play as a man on the edge—burdened by debt, a sick child, and a broken family. Since his wife left, life has fallen into quiet despair. Then, a mysterious letter arrives, signed only 'TG'. One offer: descend into the crypt of Emelin and steal three golden artifacts—in exchange for a life-changing sum of money. With no other choice, he enters the tomb… and the nightmare begins.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Explore creepy places, collect or combine items, read notes and solve puzzles. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.poster.avif?t=1780755955\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.webm?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.mp4?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-<strong>  </strong>Learn when to hide and when to fight, as well as how to fight.  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.poster.avif?t=1780755955\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.webm?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.mp4?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- <strong>Find your way to survive in a dark and unfriendly environment.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCALIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is localized in four languages using the Steam depots method. To play in a different language, open your Steam Library and select Crypt Robbery. Click the gear icon on the right to open Settings, then choose Properties. Under the Language tab, select your preferred language. You may need to restart the Steam application for the changes to take effect</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.poster.avif?t=1780755955\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.webm?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/7a172514544c8afd13292cb4a3cbda3a.mp4?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crypt Robbery blends shooting and horror elements in a gritty, old-school style—crafted by a solo developer.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It’s a challenging experience, so consulting the Steam Community guide is highly recommended.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can play in two ways:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• \tMain Story: Dive into the story, with a slow progress, dominated by horror.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• \tMini-Games: Face off in challenges like Waves of Evil—a moderately paced survival FPS mode with limited time and scarce resources.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.poster.avif?t=1780755955\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.webm?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/dfa6d2ff3884ce4316223b7983a7303a.mp4?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You play as a man on the edge—burdened by debt, a sick child, and a broken family. Since his wife left, life has fallen into quiet despair. Then, a mysterious letter arrives, signed only 'TG'. One offer: descend into the crypt of Emelin and steal three golden artifacts—in exchange for a life-changing sum of money. With no other choice, he enters the tomb… and the nightmare begins.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Explore creepy places, collect or combine items, read notes and solve puzzles. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.poster.avif?t=1780755955\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.webm?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/83a52d621412f96ae2ccb92bf102838d.mp4?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-<strong>  </strong>Learn when to hide and when to fight, as well as how to fight.  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.poster.avif?t=1780755955\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.webm?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362670/extras/004d266f495e78a1c2c05f375a1c89f0.mp4?t=1780755955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- <strong>Find your way to survive in a dark and unfriendly environment.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCALIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is localized in four languages using the Steam depots method. To play in a different language, open your Steam Library and select Crypt Robbery. Click the gear icon on the right to open Settings, then choose Properties. Under the Language tab, select your preferred language. You may need to restart the Steam application for the changes to take effect</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A chilling survival-horror FPS set in a creepy, atmospheric world. Explore a haunted cemetery, descend into a cursed crypt, and face the horrors that lurk below. Hide, fight, survive—do you have what it takes to make it out alive?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.